{
 "about": "M2.2: coco_lab split into Python packs the Arena worker loads lazily. 'core' (coco_lab.zip, every module not listed below) is what the Plan lens needs and loads at boot; a lens's pack loads the first time the lens is selected. build_arena_assets.mjs refuses a module in two packs, and an import that crosses packs except into core or into a pack listed in 'requires'. G1: 'game' (Fetch Rush rules and Grasp Assist) loads before a game session boots; R1: 'experiments' (coco_lab.experiments, its families, scenarios, statistics and the benchmark suites) loads before a Workbench worker runs; R2: 'user' (coco_lab.exp_user and the built-ins behind the algorithm API) loads with the experiments; coco_lab.api and coco_lab.user_code are core.",
